.TH VIETTELEX-SETTINGS 1 "2026-09-26" "VietTelex" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
viettelex-settings \- settings for the VietTelex Vietnamese input method
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B viettelex-settings
[\fB\-\-onboarding\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-onboarding\fR] [\fB\-\-page\fR \fITAB\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configures VietTelex (Fcitx5 addon / IBus engine): typing method (Telex, VNI),
spelling options, shortcuts, per-application typing modes and the
Vietnamese/English toggle key. Settings are written to
\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/viettelex/config.toml\fR and \fIshortcuts.yml\fR and apply
immediately to the running input method.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-onboarding
Open the guide for enabling the input method in Fcitx5 or IBus.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-onboarding
Do not open the guide automatically when the input method is not enabled yet.
.TP
.BI \-\-page " TAB"
Open a tab: typing, options, shortcuts, modes or about.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/viettelex/config.toml
.br
.I ~/.config/viettelex/shortcuts.yml
